Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Post expense accruals on the order date instead of the
 system date

Expense accrual vouchers were dated with the day posting ran, so a June
order's expenses posted in October landed in October and could fall into
a different financial year. They now use the supply order date, falling
back to the expense entry's creation date. Already-posted vouchers are
untouched. Approved by the user on 2026-10-07 per AGENTS.md rule 4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KADv3CQwxtAEgegiWVSynB
