Permission checks trusted whatever user id the screen sent and fell back
to the first admin when none was sent, and 51 IPC channels worked before
login. The main process now keeps the logged-in user: every channel except
login, password change, logout and static metadata requires an active
session, and permission checks use only the session user. Adds a Settings >
